  "implementationDetails": {
    "audioStrategy": "One AudioContext and one output node. A TypeScript DSP kernel (src/audio/dsp/stage.ts) runs in an AudioWorklet, or in a ScriptProcessorNode when the worklet is unavailable. Grand, Upright, and Electric play bundled recordings (198 FLAC files, 12 MB, decoded by the app's own FLAC decoder). Clav, Digital, and Misc are live additive synthesis and are labelled as synthesis in the model name, on the Program display, and in the status console. If a sample set cannot be loaded, its layer plays a synthesized stand-in voice labelled \"Fallback Synth Piano\", the type LED flashes, and the audio status reads Fallback, never Ready. All effects are computed live in the kernel; no impulse responses or other audio buffers are bundled or generated.",
